          <change when="2021-01-17T08:03:16-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">Vote - Accept-Straight-to-Finalization - Fine. Also worth recording are the line fillers in lines 3 and 20, and the diaeresis in lin36 (Τραιανοῦ), and the strokes over the numbers in lines 31 and 37. The document is cancelled but this only applies to lines 1–31, not to 32–7. Add |reg| for Ἐπὶπ (lin31), προκι[μένας (lin33), and προκιμέ[ν]ης (lin35). At finalisation, ensure there is space before ἔτους in lin17, and ideally remove superfluous space created by the number tags in lines 11 and 34.  </change>
